# 17. EXPLORATION → BLACKSMITH CONNECTION

Blacksmith tidak menghasilkan material.

Blacksmith hanya menggunakan material yang sudah dikumpulkan melalui:

```text
World Exploration
      ↓
Inventory
      ↓
Blacksmith
      ↓
Crafting
```

Contoh:

```text
Floor 10 Cleared
       ↓
Exploration Lv.1
       ↓
Iron Ore
       ↓
Inventory
       ↓
Blacksmith Lv.1
       ↓
Iron Sword
```

---

# 18. FLOOR UNLOCK RULE

Exploration Level tidak dapat dibuka sebelum Master mencapai floor tertentu.

```text
Floor < 10
   ↓
Exploration Lv.1 LOCKED
```

```text
Floor 10
   ↓
Exploration Lv.1 UNLOCKED
```

```text
Floor 20
   ↓
Exploration Lv.2 UNLOCKED
```

```text
Floor 30
   ↓
Exploration Lv.3 UNLOCKED
```

```text
Floor 40
   ↓
Exploration Lv.4 UNLOCKED
```

```text
Floor 50
   ↓
Exploration Lv.5 UNLOCKED
```

Setelah terbuka, level Exploration **tetap terbuka** dan tidak perlu dibuka kembali.

