**Core Rule:**

```text
FLOOR PROGRESS
      ↓
EXPLORATION UNLOCK
      ↓
MATERIAL ACCESS
      ↓
BLACKSMITH LEVEL
      ↓
CRAFTING TIER
      ↓
EQUIPMENT
```

Sistem ini membuat **Tower Progress → World Exploration → Material → Blacksmith → Equipment** menjadi satu progression chain yang saling terhubung.
